<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network reduced. [CORRECTED 17:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network reduced. [CORRECTED 17:20 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said its U.S. priority list committee downgraded Paging Network Inc to its recommended list from the priority list. (Corrects to show that downgrade was made by U.S. priority list committee, instead of analyst Barry Kaplan.)</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to six.</p>
</text>
